  "comments": "Gallows Corner Flyover Refurbishment - [A12] Eastern Avenue East (All directions) at the junction of [A12] Colchester Road - Gallows Corner flyover and roundabout is closed on A12 and A127 and all approaches to facilitate reconstructing and resurfacing. ",
  "currentUpdate": "Gallows Corner approaches are closed as follows, (A12) Eastern Avenue eastbound at Pettits Lane.  (A12) Colchester Road westbound is closed at Whitelands Way.   (A118) Main Road eastbound closed at Upper Brentwood Road, (A127) Southend Arterial Road westbound closed at Squirrels Heath Road, Straight Road is closed southbound at Shenstone Gardens. Northbound traffic on Southend Arterial Road is slow moving with queues leading back to Wingley Lane. Northbound traffic is slow moving on Ardleigh Green Road with queues from Nelmes Way. Additionally Eastbound traffic along Squirrels Heath Lane is slow moving with queues from Upper Brentwood Road. Expect delays on diversion. \r\n\r\n\r\n",
